  "version": "1.0.0-alpha.66",
  "notes": "# 1.0.0-alpha.66\n\n## 中文\n\n- 查询历史改用表格显示 SQL 摘要、连接、执行结果和耗时。详情使用与查询编辑器一致的高亮查看完整 SQL，支持复制和重新打开。可删除单条本机历史，已收藏的 SQL 仍可查看。\n- 移除数据页的截断预览提示，单元格详情仍可查看完整值。拉开快速打开中搜索框与对象加载范围控件的间距。\n- 「关于 DBFolio」精简为版本和项目信息，移除累积的历史更新日志。\n\n## English\n\n- Query history now uses a table with SQL previews, connections, results, and execution times. Open a record to view the complete SQL with the same highlighting as the query editor, copy it, or reopen it in a new tab. You can delete individual local history records while keeping their saved favorites.\n- Removed the truncated-preview notice from the data view. Cell details still offer access to the complete value. Quick Open now has more space between the search field and the object scope selector.\n- About DBFolio shows the version and project information in a compact layout.\n\n## 提交记录 / What's Changed\n\n- feat: 改进查询历史并准备 alpha.66 [skip ci] ([36e017a](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/36e017a728aaa40fcf52192a438464422e654fbd))\n- fix: 精简关于页面 ([c3dd49d](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/c3dd49d510df0f967b946a107b263a8c863081b6))\n- chore: 发布 1.0.0-alpha.65 更新索引 ([8c77216](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/8c772163fce419d080e6de0b3ef55bd5bb8212ab))\n- fix: 修正发版脚本的 GitHub CLI 字段参数 [skip ci] ([cc64e4a](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/cc64e4ab71c8ad56edaf7784992b06252236621c))\n- fix: 保留已签名更新元数据的时间字符串 [skip ci] ([9ee5b00](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/9ee5b000e835343232ee3838a85003a1d6ba2e66))\n- ci: 增加 macOS Developer ID 签名和公证构建 ([23ec88f](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/commit/23ec88fa3e326fe2099343be438e77872dafa8b9))\n\n## Full Changelog\n\n[v1.0.0-alpha.65...v1.0.0-alpha.66](https://github.com/SerLiunx-ctrl/dbfolio/compare/v1.0.0-alpha.65...v1.0.0-alpha.66)\n",
